{"sha":"328fc47ea0bcc27d9afa69c3ad6e52431cadd76c","node_id":"MDY6Q29tbWl0MjMyNTI5ODozMjhmYzQ3ZWEwYmNjMjdkOWFmYTY5YzNhZDZlNTI0MzFjYWRkNzZj","commit":{"author":{"name":"Vlad Yasevich","email":"vladislav.yasevich@hp.com","date":"2008-08-27T23:08:54Z"},"committer":{"name":"David S. Miller","email":"davem@davemloft.net","date":"2008-08-27T23:08:54Z"},"message":"sctp: correct bounds check in sctp_setsockopt_auth_key\n\nThe bonds check to prevent buffer overlflow was not exactly\nright.  It still allowed overflow of up to 8 bytes which is\nsizeof(struct sctp_authkey).\n\nSince optlen is already checked against the size of that struct,\nwe are guaranteed not to cause interger overflow either.\n\nSigned-off-by: Vlad Yasevich <vladislav.yasevich@hp.com>\nSigned-off-by: David S. Miller <davem@davemloft.net>","tree":{"sha":"5969688468a63ee01db68be4adff671bd9aa85c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/git/trees/5969688468a63ee01db68be4adff671bd9aa85c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/git/commits/328fc47ea0bcc27d9afa69c3ad6e52431cadd76c","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/commits/328fc47ea0bcc27d9afa69c3ad6e52431cadd76c","html_url":"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/commit/328fc47ea0bcc27d9afa69c3ad6e52431cadd76c","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/commits/328fc47ea0bcc27d9afa69c3ad6e52431cadd76c/comments","author":null,"committer":{"login":"davem330","id":1053866,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTM4NjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1053866?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davem330","html_url":"https://github.com/davem330","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davem330/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davem330/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davem330/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davem330/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davem330/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davem330/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davem330/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davem330/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davem330/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"f2455eb176ac87081bbfc9a44b21c7cd2bc1967e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/commits/f2455eb176ac87081bbfc9a44b21c7cd2bc1967e","html_url":"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/commit/f2455eb176ac87081bbfc9a44b21c7cd2bc1967e"}],"stats":{"total":2,"additions":1,"deletions":1},"files":[{"sha":"9b9b2c31dd15c780eac5d80e5fcae45572b781bf","filename":"net/sctp/socket.c","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changes":2,"blob_url":"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/328fc47ea0bcc27d9afa69c3ad6e52431cadd76c/net%2Fsctp%2Fsocket.c","raw_url":"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/raw/328fc47ea0bcc27d9afa69c3ad6e52431cadd76c/net%2Fsctp%2Fsocket.c","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/contents/net%2Fsctp%2Fsocket.c?ref=328fc47ea0bcc27d9afa69c3ad6e52431cadd76c","patch":"@@ -3144,7 +3144,7 @@ static int sctp_setsockopt_auth_key(struct sock *sk,\n \t\tgoto out;\n \t}\n \n-\tif (authkey->sca_keylength > optlen) {\n+\tif (authkey->sca_keylength > optlen - sizeof(struct sctp_authkey)) {\n \t\tret = -EINVAL;\n \t\tgoto out;\n \t}"}]}